{"seq":2,"slug":"common-progressions","title":"流行与古典常用和声进行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/common-progressions","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"流行与古典常用和声进行\">流行与古典常用和声进行</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>和声进行是功能逻辑在时间上的具体排布，不同风格传统各自发展出高度模式化的进行库。理解它们的关键在于分辨两条线索：流行音乐以少量四和弦循环（如 Axis Progression）反复强化情感条件反射，古典音乐则让进行服务于更大尺度的曲式与调性运动。二者共享下五度、级进等基本连接逻辑，却对&quot;循环&quot;与&quot;发展&quot;有截然不同的取舍。后文从流行极简主义、经典进行、古典逻辑到情感与创新逐个展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流行音乐的和声极简主义\">流行音乐的和声极简主义</h2><p>当代流行音乐的和声语言呈现显著的集中化趋势——少量和弦进行主导了排行榜上绝大多数作品。这并非&quot;偷懒&quot;，而是因为这些进行经过数十年的听众训练，已经形成了强大的情感条件反射。创作者可以将注意力集中在旋律、歌词与制作音色上，让和声框架提供可靠的情感基底。</p>\n<p>2022 年 Spotify 数据分析显示，全球 Top 100 流行歌曲中约 65% 使用不超过四个和弦的循环进行。最常见的进行模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>排名</th>\n<th>进行</th>\n<th>情感色彩</th>\n<th>使用频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I-V-vi-IV</td>\n<td>积极中带忧伤</td>\n<td>~28%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>vi-IV-I-V</td>\n<td>忧伤中带希望</td>\n<td>~18%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I-IV-V-IV</td>\n<td>开朗、驱动</td>\n<td>~12%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I-vi-IV-V</td>\n<td>经典怀旧</td>\n<td>~9%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>i-VI-III-VII</td>\n<td>小调史诗感</td>\n<td>~8%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 最流行的四和弦循环变体&#10;        A[&quot;I-V-vi-IV&lt;br/&gt;(Axis Progression)&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;vi-IV-I-V&lt;br/&gt;(从vi开始)&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;IV-I-V-vi&lt;br/&gt;(从IV开始)&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;V-vi-IV-I&lt;br/&gt;(从V开始)&quot;]&#10;        A --- B --- C --- D&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 最流行的四和弦循环变体\n        A[\"I-V-vi-IV&lt;br/&gt;(Axis Progression)\"]\n        B[\"vi-IV-I-V&lt;br/&gt;(从vi开始)\"]\n        C[\"IV-I-V-vi&lt;br/&gt;(从IV开始)\"]\n        D[\"V-vi-IV-I&lt;br/&gt;(从V开始)\"]\n        A --- B --- C --- D\n    end</pre><p>这四个进行实际上是同一组和弦的不同起始点循环（称为 Axis Progression），它们之间可以自由切换而不破坏和声逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经典进行的深度分析\">经典进行的深度分析</h2><p><strong>Canon 进行</strong>（I-V-vi-iii-IV-I-IV-V）：</p>\n<p>源自 Pachelbel《卡农》（约 1680 年），是西方音乐史上最具辨识度的八和弦进行。其成功的秘密在于：低音线呈现优美的阶梯式下行（do-si-la-sol-fa-mi-fa-sol），同时每一步的和弦连接都遵循五度关系或级进关系。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>低音线：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{低音线：} C - B - A - G - F - E - F - G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">低音线：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Andalusian 终止</strong>（i-VII-VI-V）：</p>\n<p>源自弗拉门戈的下行小调进行，如 Am-G-F-E。小调主和弦逐步下行到属大和弦的过程，产生宿命感与异域色彩。Sultans of Swing（Dire Straits）、Hit the Road Jack（Ray Charles）都使用这一进行。</p>\n<p><strong>12 小节布鲁斯</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^7 - I^7 - I^7 - I^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IV^7 - IV^7 - I^7 - I^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^7 - IV^7 - I^7 - V^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>布鲁斯进行的独特之处在于：所有和弦都使用属七音型（包括主和弦 I7），这在古典和声中是&quot;违规&quot;的——属七和弦理论上应解决到主和弦，但在布鲁斯中它是稳定色彩。这种&quot;错用&quot;产生了布鲁斯特有的张力美学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"古典音乐中的和声逻辑\">古典音乐中的和声逻辑</h2><p>古典音乐的和声进行服务于更大尺度的曲式结构，不像流行音乐那样简单循环。几种核心的古典和声范式：</p>\n<p><strong>下五度进行</strong>（Circle of Fifths Progression）：和弦根音按下行五度序列排列。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I \\to IV \\to vii° \\to iii \\to vi \\to ii \\to V \\to I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ii</span><span class=\"mord\">°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">iii</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ii</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一步都是最自然的功能流动方向。这一进行在巴洛克音乐（Vivaldi、Handel）中无处不在。</p>\n<p><strong>线性低音进行</strong>：低音声部做级进或半音下行，和弦随之变化。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Romanesca 低音：</mtext><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Romanesca 低音：} I - V^6 - vi - III^6 - IV - I^6 - IV - V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Romanesca </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">低音：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>典型和声特征</th>\n<th>代表作曲家</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>巴洛克</td>\n<td>持续低音、五度圈</td>\n<td>Bach, Handel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>古典</td>\n<td>清晰T-S-D-T、终止明确</td>\n<td>Mozart, Haydn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浪漫</td>\n<td>半音化、远关系转调</td>\n<td>Chopin, Wagner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印象</td>\n<td>平行和弦、全音阶</td>\n<td>Debussy, Ravel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20世纪</td>\n<td>非功能、对称结构</td>\n<td>Bartók, Messiaen</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"和声进行的情感编程\">和声进行的情感编程</h2><p>不同的和声进行唤起不同的情感反应，这种对应关系可以被有意识地利用在创作中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>欢乐/胜利：</mtext><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mtext>（纯正格进行）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{欢乐/胜利：} I - IV - V - I \\text{（纯正格进行）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">欢乐</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">胜利：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（纯正格进行）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>忧伤/思念：</mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mtext>（小调色彩开头）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{忧伤/思念：} vi - IV - I - V \\text{（小调色彩开头）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">忧伤</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">思念：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（小调色彩开头）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>紧张/悬疑：</mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mtext>（和声小调）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{紧张/悬疑：} i - iv - V - i \\text{（和声小调）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">紧张</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">悬疑：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（和声小调）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>史诗/壮阔：</mtext><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mtext>（调式互换 bVII）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{史诗/壮阔：} I - bVII - IV - I \\text{（调式互换 bVII）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">史诗</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">壮阔：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">bV</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（调式互换</span><span class=\"mord\"> bVII</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>梦幻/漂浮：</mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mtext>（主下属交替）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{梦幻/漂浮：} IVmaj7 - I - IVmaj7 - I \\text{（主下属交替）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">梦幻</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">漂浮：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（主下属交替）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;目标情感&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;选择进行模式&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;配合节奏与音色&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;最终情感效果&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;明亮 → 大调 I 开头&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;忧伤 → vi 或 i 开头&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;悬疑 → 半音/三全音&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[&quot;史诗 → bVII 借用&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"目标情感\"] --&gt; B[\"选择进行模式\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"配合节奏与音色\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"最终情感效果\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"明亮 → 大调 I 开头\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"忧伤 → vi 或 i 开头\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"悬疑 → 半音/三全音\"]\n    B --&gt; B4[\"史诗 → bVII 借用\"]</pre><h2 id=\"当代流行中的和声创新\">当代流行中的和声创新</h2><p>虽然&quot;四和弦循环&quot;仍然占据主流，2023-2025 年的流行音乐出现了几个值得注意的和声创新方向：</p>\n<p><strong>调式互换普及化</strong>：bVI 和 bVII 和弦在流行音乐中的使用频率显著上升。Billie Eilish 的多首作品（如&quot;bad guy&quot;、&quot;Happier Than Ever&quot;）大量使用来自平行小调的借用和弦。</p>\n<p><strong>爵士和声流行化</strong>：Doja Cat、SZA、Steve Lacy 等新生代 R&amp;B/Pop 艺人的作品引入了 maj9、m11 等延伸和弦，模糊了流行与爵士的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>微调性模糊</strong>：部分先锋流行作品（如 Arca、Caroline Polachek）有意制造调性中心的模糊感，使用非功能和声进行让听众处于&quot;漂浮&quot;状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>创新方向</th>\n<th>技法</th>\n<th>代表艺人</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调式互换</td>\n<td>bVI、bVII</td>\n<td>Billie Eilish</td>\n<td>暗色流行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延伸和弦</td>\n<td>maj9、m11</td>\n<td>Steve Lacy</td>\n<td>精致都市</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声部导向</td>\n<td>半音内声部移动</td>\n<td>Jacob Collier</td>\n<td>微妙色变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和声极简</td>\n<td>单和弦 drone</td>\n<td>Travis Scott</td>\n<td>催眠律动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流行音乐高度集中：Top 榜单多数作品只用不超过四个和弦的循环。</li>\n<li>Axis Progression（I-V-vi-IV）及其循环起点变体是最主流的模式。</li>\n<li>经典进行各有来历：Canon 进行、Andalusian 终止、12 小节布鲁斯。</li>\n<li>古典进行服务曲式，核心是下五度圈与线性低音，各时期特征分明。</li>\n<li>进行可被当作情感编程：大调开头明亮、vi/i 开头忧伤、半音悬疑、bVII 史诗。</li>\n<li>当代创新方向：调式互换普及、爵士和声流行化、调性模糊。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>这些进行为何&quot;好听&quot;，要从功能和声的 T-S-D-T 逻辑理解：<a href=\"functional-harmony\">功能和声与进行模型</a></li>\n<li>进行的情感色彩与和弦循环的速率密切相关：<a href=\"harmonic-rhythm\">和声节奏与曲式结构</a></li>\n<li>转调进行（如下五度圈、远关系转调）的机制详见：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/scales-keys/modulation\">转调技法</a></li>\n<li>把和声进行铺成完整编曲（流行/爵士），见编配章节：<a href=\"../../arrangement-orchestration/ensembles-styles/pop-jazz-arranging\">流行与爵士编配</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流行与古典常用和声进行","id":"流行与古典常用和声进行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流行音乐的和声极简主义","id":"流行音乐的和声极简主义"},{"level":2,"text":"经典进行的深度分析","id":"经典进行的深度分析"},{"level":2,"text":"古典音乐中的和声逻辑","id":"古典音乐中的和声逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"和声进行的情感编程","id":"和声进行的情感编程"},{"level":2,"text":"当代流行中的和声创新","id":"当代流行中的和声创新"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"功能和声与进行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/functional-harmony"},"next":{"title":"和声节奏与曲式结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/harmonic-rhythm"}}